From df97ff09bd483cfc6ce7af8e7673f10e65cb0df4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spotUP <retroranksmail@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:54:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 25/25] upkg: browse runs in the upkg process over libupkgui

browse draws its list, info box and program view with libupkgui from the package
hash in memory and runs install, remove and upgrade through opkg_cmd_exec. The
upkg-browse script, list-browse and the browse list files are gone.
---
